# Endurance's evoke cost, "Exile a green card from your hand" (CR 118.9): the Endurance being cast is on the stack, not in
# the hand, so with only non-green cards beside it the evoke is not offered (! Cast with Ability: Evoke). On turn 3 a Llanowar
# Elves is drawn and the same evoke is offered and taken (the positive control): the Elves are exiled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Endurance
Forest
Mountain
Forest
Mountain
Forest
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
! Bot1.Hand.Endurance.Cast(Ability: Evoke)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Endurance.Cast(Ability: Evoke)
Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot1)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest
